From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 19:39:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(compliance): verify JWTs with the service-role apikey
 like /v1/deals

GoTrue 401 "Invalid or expired token" on a fresh login was the /auth/v1/user
call using SUPABASE_ANON_KEY (or the user token) as apikey. Screener
/v1/deals already uses SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY. Match that, surface
auth.apikeySource on /health, and stop treating the JWT secret as an apikey.
